 United States-Pacific Trade and Investment Policy, it is\nhereby ordered that Executive Order 12964 of June 21, 1995, as amended\nby Executive Order 12987 of January 31, 1996, is further amended in section\n2 by deleting in the first sentence ‘‘December 31, 1996’’ and inserting ‘‘Feb-\nruary 28, 1997’’ in lieu thereof.\nœ–\nTHE WHITE HOUSE,\nDecember 26, 1996.\n[FR Doc. 96–33336\nFiled 12–27–96; 10:25 am]","path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/texts/cd-job-fr-originals-13032-bb0f01748e.txt","sha256":"c2bfb5ae704d01aa3d34ae5d6af0fba6c4281b27e86ba29c226d9bc03c899122","source":{"line":3354,"path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"1e40ef534422c0614b3524e28376a578e726756a7b5de809958ba7b9965d9fef"}},{"first_1500_characters":"Instrument: EO:13032\nSource: https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-12-30/pdf/96-33336.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: bb0f01748e354bd2940bcb94476da7bb54444329922c6daf46823c0c744f7973\nLocation: 61 FR 68985, PDF pages 1-1 (confidence high)\nMachine-extracted text layer of the official PDF (OCR for 1936-1994 scans). May contain recognition errors and parts of neighbouring documents on the same pages. Not an authenticated transcription: check the PDF pages.\n\n=== PDF page 1 of 1 ===\nPresidential Documents\n68985\nFederal Register\nVol. 61, No. 251\nMonday, December 30, 1996\nTitle 3—\nThe President\nExecutive Order 13032 of December 26, 1996\nFurther Amendment to Executive Order No. 12964\nBy the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and the\nlaws of the United States of America, including the Federal Advisory Commit-\ntee Act, as amended (5 U.S.C. App.), and to facilitate the work of the\nCommission on United States-Pacific Trade and Investment Policy, it is\nhereby ordered that Executive Order 12964 of June 21, 1995, as amended\nby Executive Order 12987 of January 31, 1996, is further amended in section\n2 by deleting in the first sentence ‘‘December 31, 1996’’ and inserting ‘‘Feb-\nruary 28, 1997’’ in lieu thereof.\nœ–\nTHE WHITE HOUSE,\nDecember 26, 1996.\n[FR Doc. 96–33336\nFiled 12–27–96; 10:25 am]\nBilling code 3195–01–P","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_13032.txt","sha256":"e216876aab4b406cbd8e8d9d31b0168699dc92b627bdd52c438728a143da8c82","source":{"line":2010,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"a813e993749edcfcd6595f944dece55a1e82fda50bf11b38e7fe9c487da80330"}}]}
